-- Offline emulation of a Snowflake masking policy on the email column. In Snowflake this would be
--   create masking policy email_mask as (val string) returns string ->
--     case when current_role() in ('ANALYST_FULL') then val else '***MASKED***' end;
-- DuckDB has no masking policies and no roles, so CURRENT_ROLE() is the dbt var `role`, set per run.
-- VAL is replaced by the column expression when check.sh composes the query.
case when '{{ var("role") }}' in ('ANALYST_FULL') then VAL else '***MASKED***' end
